Your Name Here BBS  /* bbs name */
SYSOP      /* sysop name */
SYSOP NEW  /* names new users are NOT allowed (as many as you want) */
DF0: /* must be an 'info' compatible device name for BBS:, try from CLI */
79   /* greater than this level = SYSOP status */
BBS:         /* bbs path. path to Lists, Email, FileNotes, Logs, etc.*/
BBS:BBS_MSGS /* conference path. Path to the message base */
BBS:BBS_LIBS /* library path. Path to file base (notes are in bbspath) */
BBS:Spell    /* spellpath only used if Spell Check flag is on (below) */
CD0: CD1:    /* extra device list (unavailable devices will be ignored) */
1000   /* maximum conference msgs before purging oldest with bbsMAINT.baud */
100000 /* minimum bytes available to still allow uploading */
300    /* seconds at prompt with no activity before hangup   */
600    /* seconds for new user to enter his data (600=10 mins) */
2400   /* maximum baudrate to set your modem */
1      /* Grin at start.     NOTE: lines 16-29 & 36-40 are 0=OFF or 1=ON */
1      /* Grin at end */
0      /* 'log' sent to printer (PRT:) as well as logfile */
0      /* Upload/Download ratios. */
0      /* Spell Check */
0      /* Uploaded files must be approved by SYSOP */
0      /* Auto-validation (set to new user level) */
1      /* report new users to sysop */
1      /* report new files to sysop */
0      /* Use BBS:Scratch instead of RAM:Scratch (for de-bugging) */
1      /* uploads by user extend current session time  (free uploads) */
1      /* open workbench window to display current user */
0      /* Force sounds off. 1=No sound effects are used by BBBBS, 0=sounds ON */
1      /* Move Email to sysop's email drawer instead of just deleting */
200000 /* Minimum RAM needed to continue Resident mode. 0=Non-resident */
3      /* calls per day per user */
.lha                  /* archive extension. Blank defaults to .lzh */
lha >ram:junk -2a m   /* arccom. Blank defaults to lharc >ram:junk -m m */
3      /* Left edge of WorkBench user window (window is 640 pixels wide) */
14     /* Top of WorkBench user window (window is 66 pixels tall) */
1      /* "busywait" blinks curser during searches, etc. */
1      /* Call Back Verification. */
1      /* Speak User name at logon. */
0      /* sysop appears in Usage/USER.LOG (shown with "V" command) */
10     /* set NEW USER pointers to last file & newest <n> msgs per conf */
15     /* min mins between same user calls (if last call >50% maxtime) */
000 FEF 79F FAC D7F DD7 CCF 7FA   /* Screen Dimmer Prefs (see below) */
1      /* Show user's real name in Other User Info display */

